Native Carry C3 Crosswalk

This repository contains an original Lean integration and consolidation layer
by Thiago Massensini around the following pinned upstream projects:

  CPFormal / primos
  https://github.com/thiagomassensini/primos
  revision 537028681ae6a775c083a1e2fb6e67db24697b82

  Native Carry Spectral Weyl
  https://github.com/thiagomassensini/native-carry-spectral-weyl
  revision ca726315be2eb9b421c07224a07967d02d07f0fb

Their transitive dependencies include Finite Native Carry Operator and Green
Frame at the revisions recorded in `lake-manifest.json`. Dependencies are
fetched separately by Lake and are not vendored here. Their own terms remain
applicable to their source code.
